node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# Incremental build state. Without this the host's .tsbuildinfo is copied in,
# tsc concludes everything is already built, and emits nothing — producing an
# image whose dist directories do not exist. It fails at COPY, which is lucky;
# a slightly different Dockerfile would have shipped an empty image.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data
*.sqlite*
*.log
.codex
.claude
web
